# auto-ammo: from the menu, load the saved game setup/auto-ammo writes (10 sling stones in the
# pack, the player at (36, 7) on level 1 facing the locked door at (36, 8), 5 more sling stones
# at their feet); walk back off the square and forward onto it again. With the flag the 5 stones
# are taken onto the pack's stack ("You pick up 5 sling stones.", 15 carried); the original
# leaves them on the floor
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
7000 down x            # walk back, to (36, 6)
8000 up x
10000 down s           # walk forward, onto (36, 7) again
11000 up s
